    "probe_text": "Based on a full read of the create-owner path, here is every validation and side-effect, in the order it actually applies. Nothing was changed.\n\n## Where it lives\n- **Endpoint:** `POST /api/owners` \u2014 declared on the generated interface `OwnersApi` (`@Validated`, `@Valid @RequestBody OwnerFieldsDto`), implemented by `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner(...)`.\n- **Service:** `ClinicServiceImpl.findAllOwners()` / `saveOwner()`.\n- **Entity:** `Owner` (with `Person` superclass), persisted via `OwnerRepository` (Spring Data JPA).\n\n---\n\n## A. Validations (in execution order)\n\n**Phase 1 \u2014 Bean Validation on the request DTO** (runs during argument binding, before the method body):\n1. `firstName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}$)`, `@Size(1..30)`\n2. `lastName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(...{0,2}\\.?$)`, `@Size(1..30)`\n3. `address` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(^.*\\S.*$)`, `@Size(1..255)`\n4. `city` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(^.*\\S.*$)`, `@Size(1..80)`\n5. `telephone` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(E.164/AU regex)`, `@Size(1..25)`\n6. `email` \u2014 `@Size(max 255)`, `@Email`, and custom `@DisposableEmailValidation` (blocks mailinator.com, tempmail.com, guerrillamail.com)\n7. `postcode` \u2014 `@Pattern(^[0-9]{4}$)`\n8. `registrationDate` \u2014 `@PastOrPresent`\n9. **Class-level** `@PostcodeValidation` \u2014 cross-field: postcode must fall in the city's region range (Sydney 2000\u20132099, Melbourne 3000\u20133099, Brisbane 4000\u20134099); passes if postcode null/not-4-digits or city unknown.\n\n   *(Failure of any of the above \u2192 `400` via `ExceptionControllerAdvice.handleMethodArgumentNotValidException`.)*\n\n**Phase 2 \u2014 Authorization:** `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")` on the handler.\n\n**Phase 3 \u2014 Imperative business-rule checks inside `addOwner`** (each loads/uses the in-memory `findAllOwners()` collection):\n10. **Rate limit:** \u2265 100 existing owners sharing the computed `registrationDate` \u2192 `429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS`.\n11. **Identity duplicate:** `Identities.isDuplicate` (key = telephone|email|householdId) \u2192 `409 CONFLICT`.\n12. **Household duplicate:** `Households.isDuplicate`, unless `sharesHousehold == true` \u2192 `409 CONFLICT`.\n13. **City saturation:** `CityCodes.countInCity` \u2265 50 \u2192 `409 CONFLICT`.\n\n**Phase 4 \u2014 Entity-level Bean Validation on persist** (`Owner`/`Person`): `firstName`, `lastName`, `address`, `city` `@NotEmpty`; `telephone` `@NotEmpty` + `@Pattern(^\\+[0-9]{8,15}$)`.\n\n---\n\n## B. Side-effects (in execution order)\n\n**During the handler body, before save:**\n1. Map DTO \u2192 `Owner` (`ownerMapper.toOwner`) \u2014 during which the entity's normalizing setters mutate values: `setEmail` lower-cases; `setAddress` runs `PostalAddress.normalize` (trim/collapse/upper-case, expand ST/RD/AVE); `setTelephone` runs `TelephoneNumber.toE164` (assumes +61).\n2. `setHouseholdId(Households.idFor(owner))` \u2014 SHA-256-derived household id.\n3. `findAllOwners()` \u2014 DB read of **all** owners (each with EAGER pets).\n4. `setRegistrationDate(BusinessDays.effective(owner))` \u2014 default to today, roll weekend \u2192 Monday.\n5. `setHouseholdMemberCount(Households.size(...))`\n6. `assignCustomerCode(...)` \u2014 sets `customerCode = CustomerCode.of(this)` (region + SHA-256 hash; ignores its int arg).\n7. `setNamesakeCount(Namesakes.count(...))`\n8. `setBulkSignupWarning(BulkSignups.exceededDailyLimit(...))` \u2014 >80 same-day signups.\n9. `setPossibleDuplicateOf(PossibleDuplicates.matchId(...))`\n\n**Persist:**\n10. `clinicService.saveOwner(owner)` \u2014 `@Transactional`; `ownerRepository.save(owner)` INSERTs (cascading to pets).\n11. `@PrePersist Owner.defaultRegistrationDate()` \u2014 defaults `registrationDate` to today if still null.\n12. `@PostPersist OwnerAuditListener.onCreate` \u2014 logs to the `\"AUDIT\"` SLF4J logger at INFO (id, customerCode, registrationDate, membershipLevel via `MembershipLevels`).\n\n**Response construction:**\n13. `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto` \u2014 computes (not persisted) `displayName`, `membershipNumber`, `checkDigit` (Luhn), `membershipPoints`/`membershipLevel`, `locality`, `contactPreference`, `ageBand`, `telephoneDisplay`.\n14. Sets `Location: /api/owners/{id}` header, returns `201 CREATED`.\n\n---\n\n## Things explicitly NOT in the path (despite appearances)\n- **No email sending** \u2014 the only \"email\" logic is the disposable-domain validation blocklist.\n- **No event publishing, no `@Async`, no caching** (`@Cacheable`/`@CacheEvict` absent; the `ClinicServiceImpl` comment mentioning caching is stale).\n- **`Emails` uniqueness helper exists but is never called** from `addOwner` \u2014 email uniqueness is not enforced.\n- **`CallMonitoringAspect` (JMX) does not wrap the save** under the `spring-data-jpa` profile, because `SpringDataOwnerRepository` isn't annotated `@Repository`."
